WEBVTT

00:07.300 --> 00:10.230
Fall in love, boys and girls

00:10.800 --> 00:13.860
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

00:14.540 --> 00:17.440
The passion, the way it was born

00:18.180 --> 00:21.170
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

00:21.680 --> 00:24.840
How the hips shake, mucho dizzying

00:25.050 --> 00:28.080
Amigo, that's risky for a kid

00:28.550 --> 00:31.650
If I were to kiss, I'd get sucked in

00:32.360 --> 00:35.020
Tonight, I want to see something scary

00:35.930 --> 00:38.030
Don't be afraid

00:38.030 --> 00:39.460
Going from one push after another

00:39.530 --> 00:41.630
The surprising feeling is nice

00:41.630 --> 00:43.290
And you end up dancing till morning

00:43.500 --> 00:45.270
LOVE LOVE LOVE

00:45.270 --> 00:48.640
TROPICANA

00:50.370 --> 00:53.470
Catch me in the shade under the palm tree

00:54.140 --> 00:57.410
Make me wait, more than down to the limit

00:57.780 --> 01:00.810
I'm sorry, but you're already addicted

01:01.190 --> 01:04.520
From the jungle you can't escape! Haré+Guu!

01:05.020 --> 01:07.890
Fall in love, boys and girls

01:08.590 --> 01:11.650
Twinkle! Put a star in your eye

01:12.100 --> 01:15.190
The passion, the way it was born

01:15.830 --> 01:19.100
Makes sparks in the jungle! Haré+Guu!

01:35.390 --> 01:38.260
T-This lunch is so cute, Marie.

01:38.360 --> 01:40.260
Really? I'm so glad!

01:40.500 --> 01:44.520
But, you don't have to
do all of this on your day off

01:44.670 --> 01:48.210
I mean, leaving you all alone, Doctor

01:48.210 --> 01:50.830
I can't possibly do such a pitiful thing!

01:50.910 --> 01:52.530
Am I the one that's pitiful?

01:53.080 --> 01:55.170
Now, don't be bashful, eat up!

01:55.250 --> 01:56.410
S-Sure

01:57.880 --> 02:00.850
Sleeping Side-by-Side

02:11.360 --> 02:14.130
Y-Your lunch is so tasty

02:14.970 --> 02:18.060
I have something to tell you

02:18.140 --> 02:20.230
Hey, are you ignoring me?

02:20.670 --> 02:23.870
You know, there's that guy named Ashio
over at Weda's house, right?

02:23.970 --> 02:25.270
Yeah, there is

02:25.380 --> 02:29.180
The other day, during the council meeting,
Ashio confessed to Weda!

02:30.310 --> 02:31.750
A confession of true love!

02:31.820 --> 02:34.410
According to Rebecca,
he's really serious about it!

02:34.520 --> 02:35.450
Really?

02:36.090 --> 02:37.450
You're not surprised?

02:37.990 --> 02:38.960
Not really

02:40.790 --> 02:44.090
And, I heard Weda said
that she liked Ashio, too

02:49.270 --> 02:51.100
See? Isn't it shocking?

02:51.200 --> 02:53.970
N-Not really
It doesn't have anything to do with me

02:54.270 --> 02:57.100
That's a lie you're not being honest

02:58.070 --> 03:03.100
I understand how you feel. You're having a
very tough romance

03:03.350 --> 03:06.800
Oh, the pain of your heart is overflowing

03:07.120 --> 03:09.850
Not a bit I just don't get this girl

03:10.190 --> 03:11.950
But, you shouldn't give up!

03:12.020 --> 03:13.820
No, before we get to giving up or not

03:14.420 --> 03:16.830
It's all right, I'll help you out!

03:16.830 --> 03:19.260
Come on,
do your best to catch Weda's heart!

03:19.330 --> 03:21.960
Well, I've been trying to say, that doesn't
matter at all anymore

03:22.230 --> 03:23.960
Geez, she's so annoying

03:24.230 --> 03:27.300
And so, I thought about it

03:27.300 --> 03:29.530
and you're missing something

03:30.010 --> 03:33.700
You're handsome, and though a bit weak
your style is rather nice

03:33.780 --> 03:35.650
Since you're a doctor, you're smart
Some women just can't help butting in to
other people's romance

03:35.650 --> 03:37.810
You fulfill the three major requirements of a
girl seeking romance
Some women just can't help butting in to
other people's romance

03:37.880 --> 03:39.250
but why is it!?

03:40.250 --> 03:42.010
What do you think you're missing?

03:42.090 --> 03:44.050
W-Who knows what it could be?

03:44.420 --> 03:45.790
That is

03:45.790 --> 03:47.390
Yes, LOVE...

03:47.390 --> 03:48.550
It's his personality

03:50.090 --> 03:51.920
it's because he has a warped personality

03:52.300 --> 03:54.200
That was a little blunt, don't you think?

03:54.730 --> 03:55.820
I see

03:55.900 --> 03:57.870
I guess we can't do anything about it if it's
his personality

03:58.200 --> 04:00.970
Didn't you just say that
love was what I was lacking?

04:01.200 --> 04:03.140
So you're also lacking love?

04:03.270 --> 04:04.930
What do you mean "also!?"

04:05.340 --> 04:07.900
Oh, fine, think whatever you want

04:09.510 --> 04:11.570
So, what do you want?

04:11.780 --> 04:14.840
After barging into someone's room, from the
window of all places, at that

04:14.950 --> 04:19.250
Oh, can it be that you came here to cheer on
his romance, just like me, Guu?

04:19.420 --> 04:20.480
Precisely

04:21.060 --> 04:22.620
Wow, this is so wonderful!

04:22.690 --> 04:24.280
Let's team up and do our best!

04:24.390 --> 04:25.360
Right!

04:26.030 --> 04:29.230
You know, I hate to interrupt you guys as
you're having a good time here

04:29.230 --> 04:31.830
but why do you want to hook me up with
Weda?

04:33.200 --> 04:40.700
I just want you and Weda to be a happy
momma-and-papa couple, and be at my side!

04:45.050 --> 04:45.950
That's why!

04:46.480 --> 04:51.010
As for me, I want to see a happy Haré,
surrounded by his parents that get along
well with each other

04:55.290 --> 04:57.490
That's why!

04:57.790 --> 04:59.820
Wow, you're so kind, Guu!

05:00.130 --> 05:01.830
That somehow seems like a lie

05:01.930 --> 05:02.920
All right!

05:04.000 --> 05:08.230
Then, the two of us should start up a mutual
plan for their love!

05:08.340 --> 05:10.470
Sure thing, I'd love to

05:10.810 --> 05:11.710
Let's go for it!

05:11.710 --> 05:12.700
Yeah!

05:14.410 --> 05:18.350
Geez! It's not your business, so leave me
alone and go home already

05:18.680 --> 05:19.950
By the way, Guu

05:19.950 --> 05:22.390
How are they at home?

05:22.390 --> 05:24.010
Are they like lovers already?

05:25.760 --> 05:27.780
Yup, yup and?

05:28.860 --> 05:29.790
Yup, yup

05:30.160 --> 05:33.100
Oh, so nothing has changed at all!

05:33.560 --> 05:34.860
Doctor!

05:34.930 --> 05:37.830
It looks like you've still got plenty of room to
slide in!

05:39.140 --> 05:41.000
Oh, I'm getting so worked up about this!

05:42.110 --> 05:43.770
There's no point in you getting worked up
over this

05:43.840 --> 05:44.810
All right!

05:44.810 --> 05:48.910
I'm going to go now and finish up an
awesome outfit that I've been working on

05:48.910 --> 05:50.470
one that will surely catch a girl's heart!

05:50.650 --> 05:52.310
You're making something again?

05:52.680 --> 05:56.520
Then, Guu will guide him
to scout out the enemy territory

05:56.650 --> 05:59.350
Hey, why are you moving the situation
forward without asking me, huh?

05:59.860 --> 06:03.120
Quit yapping
If you're a guy, you'll act without excuses!

06:04.660 --> 06:06.860
I told you, I don't care much about it!

06:09.900 --> 06:13.490
Right now, Bell and Haré are not here,
so feel free to peek in!

06:13.570 --> 06:14.630
Eh? Really?

06:15.000 --> 06:16.800
Wait, what am I doing?

06:17.510 --> 06:21.770
Well, I guess it's like playing along with a
couple kids

06:26.980 --> 06:29.110
I feel refreshed!

06:29.520 --> 06:31.850
Oh, she just got out of the bath, I'm so lucky!

06:32.390 --> 06:33.580
Ashio?

06:38.960 --> 06:40.690
Ashio!

06:41.830 --> 06:43.320
You know, Ashio

06:44.100 --> 06:46.260
if you don't get up, I'll bite you on your
back

06:48.810 --> 06:49.740
Ouch!

06:49.810 --> 06:51.540
What are you doing, Ojou-san!

06:51.610 --> 06:52.280
Are you awake?

06:52.280 --> 06:53.900
Of course that would wake me up!

06:54.840 --> 06:57.370
Y-You know, this isn't what I heard

06:57.510 --> 06:58.810
They're really lovey-dovey and stuff

06:58.950 --> 07:01.210
They've always been like that

07:01.950 --> 07:03.440
You're saying they've always been lovey-
dovey!?

07:03.990 --> 07:05.610
Well, don't be so depressed about it

07:07.390 --> 07:12.380
On one hand, you have Ashio, a guy who's
been with Weda since she was born, and
understands her very well

07:12.730 --> 07:16.370
On the other hand, you have Clive, the guy
that toyed with young Weda a dozen or so
years ago

07:16.370 --> 07:19.100
and created the reason why she ran away
from home

07:19.970 --> 07:21.270
Of course it's obvious who'd win

07:21.270 --> 07:22.970
You can't possibly be serious about what
you just said!

07:23.340 --> 07:24.530
Serious I'm serious

07:24.640 --> 07:27.340
That was really a lighthearted way of saying
something so serious, you know

07:27.440 --> 07:28.270
Who is it?

07:28.340 --> 07:29.500
Oh, is that you, doctor?

07:30.510 --> 07:33.640
The doctor has something to discuss with
you in private

07:34.380 --> 07:35.610
Oh, well

07:37.720 --> 07:38.690
Okay then

07:44.460 --> 07:46.730
It feels so nice after a bath!

07:48.570 --> 07:50.000
Oh, it's nothing

07:50.200 --> 07:52.330
Doctor, what did you want to talk to me
about?

07:53.140 --> 07:56.110
Oh, yeah, it's nothing really serious

07:56.540 --> 07:57.410
Ouch!

07:57.410 --> 07:58.270
Who was that?

07:58.340 --> 08:00.640
Now is your chance to ask her out! Go!

08:01.180 --> 08:03.200
Oh wow! What a giant pokute!

08:04.010 --> 08:05.500
Damn her

08:05.580 --> 08:06.640
What was that?

08:06.720 --> 08:08.080
Oh, nothing

08:08.620 --> 08:12.610
You know, doesn't this situation bother you?

08:12.690 --> 08:14.450
Not really

08:14.520 --> 08:16.390
It's fun to be with you, doctor

08:17.130 --> 08:19.530
Fun? Being with me?

08:20.600 --> 08:23.500
Though we were both young, I'm the guy that
did all those things to her

08:25.000 --> 08:26.900
Perhaps she still feels something for me!?

08:29.310 --> 08:31.100
No, impossible

08:32.410 --> 08:35.310
I wonder what we'll have for dinner tonight

08:35.580 --> 08:38.980
Oh, I don't get it! What in the world is she
thinking!?

08:41.150 --> 08:43.550
Hey, there's no plot development! This is
boring!

08:49.260 --> 08:51.250
That's a pretty fat pokute

08:51.330 --> 08:52.790
Look, it's exercising

08:53.200 --> 08:54.800
Move! Move!

08:54.800 --> 08:55.970
Go! Go!

08:55.970 --> 08:57.690
Push! Push!

09:00.900 --> 09:01.730
Doctor?

09:10.750 --> 09:14.510
D-Did I really win her over with my charm?

09:18.860 --> 09:19.750
Weda

09:22.530 --> 09:23.220
Snap?

09:24.290 --> 09:28.420
Oh, Doctor, you still had the dry cleaners tag
on your outfit!

09:28.500 --> 09:30.430
D-Dry cleaning?

09:30.970 --> 09:33.230
O-Oh, I see, dry cleaning!

09:37.410 --> 09:38.930
Doctor, what's wrong?

09:39.010 --> 09:40.980
You seem different from usual

09:41.040 --> 09:42.410
Are you worried about something?

09:43.710 --> 09:45.440
No, it's nothing

09:48.650 --> 09:49.780
Damn you!!

09:49.850 --> 09:51.010
Come over here for a bit!

09:51.490 --> 09:53.080
Oh, it's Guu-chan

09:53.490 --> 09:54.580
Yoo-hoo!

09:54.990 --> 09:56.550
Yoo-hoo!

09:58.330 --> 10:00.020
Geez, it's irritating to watch you

10:00.400 --> 10:02.190
Irritating!? You know...

10:02.300 --> 10:03.830
That day over a dozen years ago

10:03.830 --> 10:06.960
what happened to the beast-like charge
you made on Weda years ago?

10:07.540 --> 10:09.160
Don't talk about it as if you've seen it!

10:09.270 --> 10:12.240
Saying things about me like that will ruin my
reputation!

10:12.810 --> 10:14.280
Such a useless man

10:14.410 --> 10:16.380
You're the most useless of them all!

10:20.520 --> 10:21.810
What's wrong?

10:22.150 --> 10:24.880
Apparently, he's gotten sick, so I'll take him
back home

10:24.990 --> 10:25.920
Oh, I see

10:28.020 --> 10:29.510
Take care!

10:34.530 --> 10:37.990
Ojou-sama, I was able to get this many
manda!

10:38.130 --> 10:39.620
You sure got a lot of them

10:39.700 --> 10:42.670
Yes I didn't think that picking mandas would
be so fun

10:45.710 --> 10:47.640
What's wrong, Guu?
You seem like you're worn out

10:50.150 --> 10:51.110
Guu?

10:51.610 --> 10:55.880
You-know-who always
moves just how I want him to

10:56.420 --> 10:57.820
Who are you talking about?

10:59.360 --> 11:01.160
What is it? You're freaking me out!

11:01.160 --> 11:02.280
Why can't you say it outright!?

11:04.930 --> 11:06.990
Don't be so down

11:07.130 --> 11:08.600
I'm with you!

11:09.070 --> 11:10.400
See?

11:12.570 --> 11:13.830
Now, look in the mirror

11:13.900 --> 11:15.840
I'm sure we can catch up with this! I'm sure!

11:18.940 --> 11:20.200
Doctor!

11:24.150 --> 11:25.110
Oh, how wonderful!

11:25.180 --> 11:25.980
Any girl would fall for you in that outfit!

11:25.980 --> 11:27.640
Is today an unlucky day or something?
Any girl would fall for you in that outfit!

11:27.720 --> 11:28.250
Oh, no! This is so perfect, there can't
possibly be anything better than this!

11:28.250 --> 11:31.020
What happened to the image
I had of a cool guy?
Oh, no! This is so perfect, there can't
possibly be anything better than this!

11:31.490 --> 11:34.420
Oh, give me back my old self that I had until
yesterday!

11:35.890 --> 11:40.390
Doctor, you don't like the outfit that I made?

11:40.560 --> 11:43.000
No, it's not anything like that

11:43.070 --> 11:45.130
No, it's all right

11:46.140 --> 11:46.800
You don't have to worry about me

11:46.800 --> 11:47.340
Hey, wait!
You don't have to worry about me

11:47.340 --> 11:47.730
Hey, wait!

11:57.180 --> 12:00.210
Why does it have to turn out like this?

12:02.050 --> 12:03.250
Good morning

12:03.550 --> 12:04.420
Hey, Haré

12:04.490 --> 12:05.350
Morning

12:06.790 --> 12:07.850
Marie, good morning

12:08.090 --> 12:09.460
It's rather chilly today

12:09.530 --> 12:10.860
Yeah, you're right

12:11.590 --> 12:13.190
Marie, isn't so cheerful today

12:13.330 --> 12:14.590
Huh? You think so?

12:17.030 --> 12:19.400
Now that you mention it, I think you're right

12:19.740 --> 12:21.330
Marie, what's wrong?

12:21.440 --> 12:22.670
You don't seem so cheerful today

12:22.740 --> 12:24.210
Why?

12:24.270 --> 12:27.040
Oh, was I wrong? I just kinda had that
impression

12:28.140 --> 12:29.540
I'm sorry, don't mind me

12:30.110 --> 12:32.740
See? You were wrong!
Don't make me have unnecessary worries!

12:33.680 --> 12:34.980
Wow, I'm so surprised

12:35.050 --> 12:36.380
Haré, you're amazing

12:36.690 --> 12:38.350
How did you figure it out?

12:38.420 --> 12:39.980
I was trying to hide it

12:42.790 --> 12:44.190
Amazing, isn't he?

12:45.030 --> 12:46.490
Yeah! He's like a psychic!

12:47.230 --> 12:49.960
And so, what's wrong? Did something
happen?

12:52.340 --> 12:57.240
I'm usually fine, but once or twice a school
year

12:57.240 --> 13:00.730
I fall into a dark mood when I'm really full of
loneliness

13:01.240 --> 13:04.740
And when that time comes, I don't know
where to put my heart

13:04.810 --> 13:07.310
I see where to put your heart

13:07.380 --> 13:08.320
Yeah

13:11.720 --> 13:15.020
Everyone else, when they're so lonely they
can't help themselves

13:15.020 --> 13:18.080
they all probably lean on a big tree that's
right beside their heart

13:18.490 --> 13:21.930
But, I don't have such a big tree at my side

13:22.000 --> 13:24.520
That's why I'm not cheerful

13:26.240 --> 13:27.830
Oh, I'm sorry

13:28.370 --> 13:31.830
But, I'll forget about all of this in about a
week, so I'll be okay

13:31.910 --> 13:33.740
I'm sorry I don't understand you very well

13:33.810 --> 13:36.610
But at times like that, let's go out and have
some fun!

13:36.950 --> 13:39.850
When you do, the lonely feeling is sure to go
away somewhere!

13:40.420 --> 13:41.610
You think so?

13:41.680 --> 13:42.780
I do

13:42.850 --> 13:44.480
Hey, Marie, what do you want to do?

13:45.590 --> 13:46.920
Well then, let's play make-believe

13:47.060 --> 13:48.960
All right, we'll do that

13:49.030 --> 13:50.010
All right, let's do it

13:50.090 --> 13:50.960
You too, Guu?

13:51.260 --> 13:52.660
All right! It's been decided!

13:52.760 --> 13:55.860
Oh, but if it's just the three of us it's a little
bit lonely

13:55.930 --> 13:58.530
Then Guu will gather two or three people to
play with us

13:58.600 --> 14:00.160
That so? I'm counting on you, then

14:01.300 --> 14:03.500
Let's play to our heart's content after school!

14:03.870 --> 14:05.360
Yup! I'm so looking forward to it!

14:05.540 --> 14:09.770
All right, Guu is being rather helpful, so we're
going to cheer up Marie!

14:12.180 --> 14:13.650
Yeah!

14:14.920 --> 14:16.350
Weda, you're playing with us?

14:16.420 --> 14:17.890
All right!

14:18.490 --> 14:20.260
Weda, you just have to play Mama!

14:20.260 --> 14:22.320
And I'm going to play the daughter!

14:22.730 --> 14:23.780
All right

14:24.090 --> 14:27.030
Hey, Guu! I'm fine with the idea of Mom
playing along, but why did you bring the
school doc as well!?

14:27.330 --> 14:29.630
And, Dr Clive, you're going to play Papa!

14:30.070 --> 14:31.430
You've got to be kidding!

14:31.430 --> 14:33.460
Mom and the school doc, husband and
wife!?

14:33.640 --> 14:35.100
Doctor, here's your chance

14:35.810 --> 14:37.330
What should I make you, Haré?

14:38.040 --> 14:39.100
Is something wrong?

14:39.180 --> 14:40.140
Uh, no

14:40.210 --> 14:44.580
Haré's says all the time that he's best suited
to play a house pet

14:44.650 --> 14:46.620
I don't say something like that all the time!

14:47.280 --> 14:49.050
Maybe you really like dogs, Haré?

14:49.050 --> 14:51.540
That's so wonderful! Animals are so cute!

14:51.650 --> 14:53.680
Yeah! Animals are the best!

14:59.100 --> 15:00.220
I'm back

15:03.170 --> 15:05.030
Meow

15:05.940 --> 15:07.200
Come on, you can bark now

15:07.200 --> 15:08.000
Yip!

15:08.700 --> 15:10.470
Oh, big brother, welcome home

15:10.540 --> 15:12.310
We're playing make-believe right now

15:12.310 --> 15:14.370
Hi! I'm Mama!

15:14.440 --> 15:18.040
Today, I'm making everyone's favorite -
shrimp gratin!

15:19.350 --> 15:21.870
That laugh you're really getting into your
acting

15:24.990 --> 15:26.420
I'm Papa

15:28.390 --> 15:30.490
If you don't want to, you could just say no

15:30.490 --> 15:31.290
And

15:31.290 --> 15:32.320
Nyanko and Wanta

15:32.460 --> 15:33.660
Bark

15:33.660 --> 15:34.630
Meow

15:34.730 --> 15:37.030
You can always say no if you don't want to
do it, Haré

15:37.130 --> 15:38.660
Big brother, you have to join now!

15:38.830 --> 15:39.700
Sure, sure

15:41.470 --> 15:43.800
Hey, this is rather realistic

15:45.710 --> 15:49.370
Oh, now my ideal family is complete!

15:50.950 --> 15:53.420
Tonight, we're having fried eggs for dinner!
Did you do your homework?

15:54.220 --> 15:57.950
And if we were living in a big white house,
then this would be perfect!

15:58.020 --> 16:00.110
Oh boy, what should I do!?

16:00.260 --> 16:03.280
I'm starting to wonder if Marie really was
lacking her usual cheerfulness

16:04.560 --> 16:05.930
Everyone, dinner's ready!

16:08.530 --> 16:10.860
It's hot, so be careful when you eat!

16:11.070 --> 16:12.090
Yes, Mama!

16:12.500 --> 16:15.600
You're so generous, to feed your cat bream
and halibut!

16:16.470 --> 16:19.770
And why do I get nothing but dog food?

16:19.980 --> 16:22.880
Yummy! Mama, you're a really good cook!

16:23.480 --> 16:24.570
Thanks

16:24.650 --> 16:27.080
Oh, this is really tasty, Weda-chan

16:27.180 --> 16:30.550
Weda makes great shrimp gratin, if nothing
else

16:30.690 --> 16:31.740
That's wrong!

16:32.660 --> 16:34.650
It's not Weda-chan! It's Mama!

16:34.720 --> 16:37.420
Big brother, Papa, you both have to say
"Mama," too!

16:37.530 --> 16:38.860
S-Sure

16:38.960 --> 16:39.760
Mama

16:40.930 --> 16:46.160
And, my papa and mama are always totally
lovey-dovey,
and they always look like newlyweds!

16:47.970 --> 16:50.230
H-Here, darling Say "Aah"

16:50.310 --> 16:51.270
Aah!

16:51.440 --> 16:55.400
And, and, Papa really likes kids, and plays
with us

16:57.180 --> 16:59.650
Hey, what do guys that like to play with kids
do?

16:59.720 --> 17:01.510
D-Don't be asking a kid that question

17:01.650 --> 17:03.850
Maybe you pick 'em up and toss them into
the air?

17:04.390 --> 17:06.510
You're so high in the air!

17:07.360 --> 17:09.090
You're so light, Marie!

17:11.130 --> 17:16.190
And, Big brother and Papa are really
chummy, and they always have guy talks

17:17.330 --> 17:21.000
Oh, you've got to hear this, Dad My
girlfriend

17:21.070 --> 17:25.170
Oh, is she cute? You're so popular with
women, just like me

17:26.540 --> 17:27.840
So fake

17:28.510 --> 17:32.280
And, Nyanko and Wanta always play with
each other

17:37.950 --> 17:38.890
And, Mama

17:39.790 --> 17:44.990
Mama is really kind, and teaches me
everything about how to love someone

17:46.560 --> 17:47.620
Marie

17:50.200 --> 17:51.360
Marie

17:54.300 --> 17:56.860
And then, at night

18:00.010 --> 18:02.200
Ojou-san, it's almost curfew

18:02.280 --> 18:03.010
Let's go home

18:03.150 --> 18:04.440
All right, all right!

18:04.510 --> 18:07.570
We've got to get going if it's curfew!

18:08.950 --> 18:10.580
Oh, that's true

18:10.650 --> 18:12.020
You have to go home now

18:12.120 --> 18:13.850
It's time for bed

18:14.090 --> 18:16.390
How was it, Marie? Do you feel any better?

18:16.460 --> 18:18.790
Y-Yeah Thanks, everyone

18:19.330 --> 18:22.230
Oh, I have to return the video I rented

18:31.810 --> 18:33.470
Then, see you later, Marie!

18:33.540 --> 18:34.840
I'll see you tomorrow!

18:35.810 --> 18:37.540
Everyone, good night!

18:37.610 --> 18:40.510
Big brother, don't fool around too much!

18:43.320 --> 18:45.310
That Marie's really responsible

18:45.420 --> 18:48.820
Mom, you're the one that's not mature at all,
even though you're an adult

18:49.660 --> 18:51.020
Hey, you over there, hush

18:51.230 --> 18:55.320
But, no matter how mature she is,
a child is still a child

18:55.400 --> 18:56.690
A child shouldn't be saying that

18:58.570 --> 19:01.800
She usually doesn't rely on adults

19:01.870 --> 19:04.010
She's more of an adult than I am

19:04.010 --> 19:07.460
I'm saying a child is nothing but a child, you
good-for-nothing teacher!

19:11.410 --> 19:13.440
You've got some nerve, Haré

19:13.820 --> 19:14.910
Why me!?

19:14.980 --> 19:15.710
Dammit, come over here!

19:15.820 --> 19:17.410
No! Wait, why me?

19:19.320 --> 19:23.450
Hey Ashio, I'm going to sleep over at Marie's
place tonight

19:23.530 --> 19:25.150
Can you tell Bell that?

19:25.230 --> 19:27.750
Eh? If I do that, she'll scold me

19:27.830 --> 19:30.300
It's all right, you'll just have to come up with
something

19:30.370 --> 19:32.390
You make it sound like it's someone else's
business!

19:32.470 --> 19:34.160
It's all right! I'm counting on you!

19:34.370 --> 19:35.700
Oh, all right

19:36.840 --> 19:38.430
Well, I'm going home, too

19:38.510 --> 19:39.440
Oh, no you're not

19:40.580 --> 19:42.510
Papa has to sleep with Marie as well

19:43.450 --> 19:44.340
Seriously?

19:47.480 --> 19:49.680
Wow! So warm!

19:50.090 --> 19:53.680
You know, this is so reassuring
It's wonderful

19:53.790 --> 19:54.950
Think so?

19:55.590 --> 19:59.120
It'd be even more wonderful if there was
nobody in the middle

19:59.830 --> 20:02.020
You want us to sleep together with you once
in a while from now on?

20:02.130 --> 20:03.100
Really!?

20:03.170 --> 20:04.530
Of course

20:04.970 --> 20:06.660
And when we do,
Papa will be together with us

20:06.900 --> 20:08.200
Geh! Me too!?

20:08.270 --> 20:11.600
Wow, I'm so happy! I'm so happy!

20:17.480 --> 20:21.510
When you're lonely, you become anxious
because you don't have something to lean
on

20:21.580 --> 20:23.850
That's why she was feeling down

20:26.220 --> 20:28.490
Marie, we're by your side

20:28.490 --> 20:30.290
So rest assured and go to sleep

20:32.260 --> 20:34.730
Right now, it really feels like we're family

20:36.030 --> 20:40.060
Maybe this isn't so bad

20:50.210 --> 20:51.300
Good morning!

20:51.410 --> 20:52.850
Oh, good morning, Marie

20:53.520 --> 20:54.950
You're energetic again

20:55.220 --> 20:56.980
Yeah, it's all thanks to you guys, Haré!

20:57.050 --> 20:58.710
Let's play make-believe again sometime

20:58.820 --> 21:00.150
Sure

21:00.290 --> 21:04.620
You know, your dog costume was just
soooooo cute!

21:04.730 --> 21:06.130
I have to take a picture of it next time!

21:06.300 --> 21:08.350
Did I look that good in it?

21:08.430 --> 21:09.160
Yeah!

21:09.270 --> 21:11.760
Well, you're always an obedient dog

21:11.830 --> 21:13.270
of course you'd look good in it

21:13.600 --> 21:16.730
It's all thanks to you bringing Weda and the
doctor over, Guu!

21:17.440 --> 21:19.670
All's well that ends well

22:35.620 --> 22:36.850
NEXT EPISODE

22:36.850 --> 22:38.790
Lately, Mom is drinking way too much...

22:38.790 --> 22:42.190
She tells me that it's all because she's bored now
that Bell and Ashio came to do everything for her...

22:42.190 --> 22:44.760
But mom's work was...cooking, cleaning, laundry...

22:44.760 --> 22:46.830
Hey, wait a minute! That was all my work!

22:46.830 --> 22:49.800
Come to think of it,
I haven't been feeling well myself because
I've been playing games so often

22:49.800 --> 22:51.600
Eh? We have a health check-up today?

22:51.600 --> 22:53.100
Oh man, what wonderful timing!

22:53.100 --> 22:54.740
It's as if someone was
planning for all of this to happen.

22:54.740 --> 22:56.740
I'm scared that Guu will do something again.

22:56.740 --> 22:58.210
Hey, Guu, you better not do anything.

22:58.210 --> 22:59.190
Of course not

23:00.670 --> 23:04.040
Next episode of Haré+Guu: "Wendy, Age 17"

23:04.040 --> 23:05.010
Who's Wendy
